      "en": "or he who exhorts, to his exhorting; he who gives, let him do it with generosity; he who rules, with diligence; he who shows mercy, with cheerfulness.",
      "ko": "혹 권위하는 자면 권위하는 일로, 구제하는 자는 성실함으로, 다스리는 자는 부지런함으로, 긍휼을 베푸는 자는 즐거움으로 할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f9bd5379c76f8fa2bde65ea2865832259fb82ad5ca629fd3a499bd7e24aff087",
      "translation_text_hash": "d32c5b4d00032abf5ee378e597e01e10da25a726b4dd622884625a3bc6dc5ee4",
